    "name": {
     "en": "Seirindō Shobō",
     "ja": "盛林堂書房"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "A secondhand bookshop founded in 1949 and on this spot since the year after, strong in mysteries and literary fiction. Ibuse Masuji and Matsumoto Seichō were customers.",
     "ja": "1949年創業、翌年からこの場所で営業する古書店。ミステリーと純文学が充実し、井伏鱒二や松本清張も訪れた。"
    },
    "location": [
