    "category": "shop",
    "name": {
     "en": "Niwatori Bunko",
     "ja": "にわとり文庫"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "A secondhand bookshop opened in 2005, a Year of the Rooster, hence the name 'Chicken Library'. Kokeshi dolls line the front, and old toys sit among the books.",
     "ja": "酉年の2005年に開いた古書店で、店名は干支にちなむ。店頭にこけしが並び、店内には古書に交じって昔のおもちゃも。"
    },
